Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm over here, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, you don't\Nhave to be so defensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My days of causing you harm\Nare long past. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after reading your history\Nwith Heaven's Door,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found myself filled with a\Ndeep sense of respect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd go so far as to say\Nwe're two peas in a pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now then i'd like to ask\Nyou a question if i may
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you see i used to call\Nthis area around here my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,home until i was four\Nor so i've spent the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to find my old\Nresidence nostalgia must have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gotten the better of me\Nrecalling one's childhood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is central to a manga\Nartist's work however those
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,memories belong to a\Nfour-year-old so they're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a little bit foggy oh that's\Nwhy i I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My question concerns this town map.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something odd about it.
