Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're situated right to left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, take a look at the shops themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the right, you can see Ariskawa,\NCaesar Drugstore, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.10,0:01:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have Ocean on the far\Nleft. See? Huh? That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The map doesn't show a road\Nbetween Ocean and the drugstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sloppy work?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, would you tag along?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would be forever in your debt if\Nyou'd be my guide for a bit. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd like to, but the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the response you give\Nafter I ask so politely?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize showing me around for\Na few meters would be such a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure is self-centered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only spare five\Nminutes, okay, Sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.92,0:02:00.72,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(1028,900)\fs60\shad1.5}Episode 17:\N {\fs80\shad2.3} Kishibe Rohan's Adventure
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.92,0:02:00.72,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(1028,900)\fs60}Episode 17:\N {\fs80} Kishibe Rohan's Adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.92,0:01:58.30,Main,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bizarre, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm checking my official Chan\Npress ultra-detailed map of Mariah,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.30,0:02:04.31,Main,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\an8}This road isn't even on the 1:3000 scale map of Morioh created by the National Map Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.86,0:02:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it makes no mention\Nof this street existing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the bright side, since\Nyour map had an error,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you might get a gift\Ncertificate at the bookstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it, this map is absolutely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look, Koichi.
