Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are mistakes everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bookstore is going to owe me more\Nthan two or three gift certificates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei, this place looks\Nlike it's been abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a weird area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The few houses that are around\Nhere look completely unoccupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look, even the vending\Nmachines are out of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made our first turn at this corner\Nwhen we came down the alleyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is too weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow we've managed to end\Nup right back where we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we turned right, left, then right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your guard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There could be an enemy nearby,\Nmanipulating things with their stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would, have Reverb fly\Noverhead and search the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From up there, I can\Nsee where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverb, act one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was something up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what, but\Nsomething just graced Reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know something came\Ninto contact with Reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, are you too lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would be happy to be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must be the enemy stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with a flick of a\Nfinger, victory is mine!
