Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.98,0:04:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've written commands in her pages,\Nso she won't be able to harm us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensei, that was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like you launched\Nyour drawing into midair!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made quite a lot of\Nprogress with my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it still doesn't work on\Nhaters like Josuke who
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't know art if it\Nkicked him in the groin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She and I are on the same wavelength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just an ordinary\Ngirl, not an enemy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she's not out to get us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't conceal anything\Nfrom heaven's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name is Reimi Sugimoto, age 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her address is 3-12 Code Daimorio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has no boyfriend and her measurements\Nare 82, 57, and 84 centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a mole by her left nipple, and her\Nfirst period came at age 11 in September.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first time she kissed a boy, he\Nrammed his tongue down her throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just about enough, Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this girl's not a stand user,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I refuse to allow you to\Nread anything else about her life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:04:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will forget everything that\Nhas just happened. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, this place trips\Na lot of people up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Several of these alleys look the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please point us in the right\Ndirection and we'll be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A simple explanation won't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your guide, so follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're sure, but you still\Nhave to hold on to the end.
