Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some girl is gonna dump you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poco fortune-telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The break tells me all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're majorly self-centered,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you have a habit of pushing\Npeople's buttons, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you're going to get dumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a load of this, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we know she's off her rocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She actually thinks I'm self-centered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about to find out\Ntwo can play at this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light pink nail polish\Nmeans you're afraid of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You often let love slip\Nthrough your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I use psychological prodding over\Nfortune-telling, but enough about your love life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something else is weighing on your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard the story about this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It said it was the scene of a murder\N15 years ago Did she say a murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, she did
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one lives in the house now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's empty. Here's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This story was told to me\Nby the old lady next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened in the dead of night,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while the young girl was\Nsleeping soundly in her bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She awoke to a strange dripping sound that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seemed to be emanating\Nfrom her parents' room,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she couldn't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:07:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sound puzzled her. Daddy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she called out, but she\Nnever heard a reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the girl wasn't particularly scared, because\Nshe was accompanied by her trusty dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he was a big guard dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the darkness, she'd offer\Nher hand to him under the bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he'd always respond\Nwith a whimper and a lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arnold was her constant reassurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the dripping that\Nhad stolen the girl from
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her peaceful slumber\Ncontinued for several minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally she'd had enough her curiosity\Ndrove her to investigate what happened next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She found arnold with his throat slashed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hanging from the coat\Nrack like an old pelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dripping sound was\Ncoming from him the sound
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of his spilling blood\Nsuddenly she heard a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming from under her bed your hand is so
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sweet and tender\Nsweetheart whimper whimper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already murdered\Nyour mommy and daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:08:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then he attacked the girl,\Nkilling her when she died!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me that story was just\Nyour way of joking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounded pretty real, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You babies, that's for\Nthe nail polish crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, my heart can't take stuff like that.
