Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the young girl in\Nthe story was yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arnold and I only exist as ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's door could only\Naccess her living memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has never happened to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you have stumbled upon the\Narea where I met my end 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we're on the same wavelength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is the gateway\Nbetween the living and the dead.
