Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Koichi, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, we're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keicho, call Reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can give us directions from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.04,0:09:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must have been the one who\Nmade contact with Reverb earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind that. Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wall appeared in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverb's actually touching the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.70,0:09:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this, but\Nyou're the one who's floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to truly escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything else is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who knows where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell do we fight a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, whatever you do, don't possess us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit treating me like a vengeful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't done a single\Nthing to either of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but somehow you've found a way to\Nscare yourselves half to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.44,0:10:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I didn't trap you guys here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're standing between the living\Nworld and the world of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two hold some kind of power, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you said they're called stands?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why you're\Nmixed up in all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're really not here to attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're even more\Nsuspicious than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm proof of\Nthat stone tape theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I became a ghost, I\Nwas bound to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been here 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all that time, I've never stopped\Npleading with people to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.98,0:10:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To let me share my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you two are the first\Nto have truly listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave you my word I'd help you get out\Nof here, so that's what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:10:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after I finish the story...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, as I was saying, the murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I got a look at his face, his\Nknife found its way into my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was late and dark, and I\Nwas doing my best to flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I died, but my killer still lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's living his life right here in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I've been aching to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only is he in town, he's blended in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's back this specter train up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you confessing all this to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, I'm not asking you to catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need you to tell someone who will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell the cops or anybody\Nelse you think is up to the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.15,0:11:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell should that kind of\Nresponsibility fall on our shoulders?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compose yourself I think it's\Nbest we remain level-headed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an absolute tragedy I'm sorry\Nyour life was stolen from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that still doesn't explain things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We find the murderers\Nso you can get closure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That all seems rather\Npointless, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be better off\Nletting go of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely moving on to the\Nnext world would be a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,better existence than\Nhaunting these alleyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you have any idea\Nhow many innocent boys
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and girls have gone\Nmissing from this town? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you should know it's eight\Ntimes the national average.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it gets even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some are being slaughtered in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's behind it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is still going on and\Nno one's done anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't just say things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to this story, you\Ndidn't even see his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you know what's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know because I see the souls of\Nhis victims dominating the skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as clear as day!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wounds of those souls\Nare the same as mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's horrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That gash is so deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't speak with those\Ntraveling to the other side,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I see them depart over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fueled by a twisted\Nobsession, one I know all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mariah has always been my\Nhome, and for fifteen years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it stood in the shadow of murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's terrifying, and on a personal\Nlevel, it's utterly humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they finally detain that wild animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my cherished Mariah will\Nhave a new reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of Japan will know it\Nas the home of a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But none of that changes the fact that\Nwe have to stop him as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's preying on someone as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing at all I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whose life will be ripped\Naway from them next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have blood\Npumping through your veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you won't take back\NMorio's peace and dignity,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then tell me who will and I'll\Nask for their help instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hope you've taken\Nwhat I've said to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've nothing more to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard you loud and clear, and\NI'm shocked no one knows about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be something we can do here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How altruistic, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This smells like treble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, this vicious killer could\Nbe a good source of inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all seems like it'd make\Nfor some interesting manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we get out if we go this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't buy the good guy act.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious that he has ulterior motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when it comes to trustworthiness,\Nthe guy's shady at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a word I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we're agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.46,0:14:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you how to get to the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? The exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do we find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you go past the mailbox,\Nyou'll find it on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you don't want to rush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a rule to making it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.62,0:14:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you make it past the mailbox,\Nyou'll see the exit about 20 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens around that corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.90,0:14:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you both to promise me\Nyou'll never look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.68,0:14:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just the rule for\Npassing to the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Arnold understands\Nsomething as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if a dog can handle it, I guess\Nthere's no reason I wouldn't be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we do look back, what happens then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, putting it in layman's terms, your\Nsouls would be dragged into the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put bluntly, you would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is look forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.72,0:15:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you feel something, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, when we passed the mailbox, something\Nflew past our legs and went behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, eyes front!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay calm and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.94,0:15:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel that, Rohan-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some kind of ominous\Npresence creeping up behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's there I don't know what\Nbut there's something right by my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just ignore it there will always be\Nsomething trying to make you look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it seems scary\Nand overwhelming but as
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long as you don't look\Nback it can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.98,0:16:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To cause you harm there's\Nsomething warm and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,runny oozing down my neck\Nignoring this thing's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gonna be a lot tougher\Nthan you're making it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sound almost there go\Nthrough the light and.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're home free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't take any more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's run for it, Rohan sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panicking will make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll try to trip you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can turn around now. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been so terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness it's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.11,0:16:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's trying to get you to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, if only you had waited for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this didn't happen when I\Ncame through here by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd they trick him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.22,0:17:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, but if we don't\Nlook, we're good to go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lucked out, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking your ability to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
