Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can calm down, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.74,0:17:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll reinscribe your ability to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The alley between the convenience\Nstore and the drugstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this is as far as we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least until he's caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When that finally happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arnold and I will look back, and\Nwe'll be reunited with Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.64,0:17:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peace and dignity must return to Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only then can we find eternal rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right here if you ever\Nwant to talk about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.12,0:18:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two don't be strangers, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here if you need me,\Nlittle Rohan, Mr. Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the bottom of my heart, I want to\Nthank you for listening to my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She had some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where does she get off\Ncalling me little Rohan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an audacious ghost girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, Reimi Sugimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.62,0:18:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has an unyielding spirit, and\Nthat's something to be respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 15 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's waged a fight for the living with
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing but her courage\Nand trusted companion.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.43,0:18:48.06,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Headline: No Leads Found in Tragic Family Massacre
