Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.85,0:18:52.11,Episode 17 Typesetting 10,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(651.429,416.857)\be0.3}Sugimoto\NReimi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is, Reimi, age 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never doubted her story, but\Nit's nice to have evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:18:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, we have a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to be Rohan\NKishibe, the manga artist, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, have we met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say you would have been\Nabout four when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't surprise me you have\Nno recollection of that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'll start by saying your\Nhouse was close to theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The night of the incident your\Nparents left home for the evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,apparently there was some urgent\Nbusiness that needed attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your parents and the Sugimoto's\Nwere very close friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they left you with them while\Nthey handled matters elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan, that night, the one that claimed\Nthe lives of the Sugimoto family,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were there and the only one rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was... there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were able to survive that nightmare?
