Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Reimi snuck me out\Nthe window and saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reimi risked everything to get you to\Nsafety before the murderer could find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.46,0:20:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder she acted so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I learned something\Nelse, my heaven's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't reveal my distant\Nmemories or personal fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ever find yourself wandering\Ndown this alleyway, a word of warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should never, ever look back.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.58,0:20:36.59,Episode 17 Typesetting 1back,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(1121.714,63.142)\be0.3}m 0 0 l 800 0 800 1000 0 1000{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.58,0:20:36.59,Episode 17 Typesetting 1a,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1131,196)}Morioh Landmark #6:
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.58,0:20:36.59,Episode 17 Typesetting 1b,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1131,285)}Ghost Girl's Alleyway
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.58,0:20:36.59,Episode 17 Typesetting 1c,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1131,635)}Location: Between the \Nconvenience store, Owson, and \NKisara Drugstore on 2-chome \Nafter getting off at the #11 bus \Nin the Kotodai Shopping District. {I had to change this a bit, so it probably needs fixing}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.58,0:20:36.59,Episode 17 Typesetting 1d,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1131,965)}{\c&H0903F9&}WARNING: {\1c}Although the vast majority \Nwill be unable to see it, if you happen \Nto find your way down this alleyway, \Ndo not turn around under \Nany circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, I really met a ghost!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.00,0:20:42.05,Main,Koichi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Her name is Reimi and that's a picture of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl you saw in that\Npicture is me dreamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already said that we believe you.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.05,0:20:46.55,Main,Koichi,0,0,0,,{\an8}I did some research, and it turns out she was a student at Budogaoka high school like us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Okuyasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Code is just my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I'd been born 15 years earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's gonna stick around, we should\Nprobably meet your ghost friend too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But fair warning, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we go to Jotaro or Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.82,0:20:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph about all this, you can bet your\Nass they'll have one question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.66,0:21:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This unknown killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he using a stand on his victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.62,0:21:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, it's up\Nto the police and courts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bloodthirsty\Nmurderer loose in Morioh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm telling you that Jotaro\Nand the Speedwagon Foundation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't going after an ordinary\Nkiller no matter how twisted he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's managed to avoid\Nthe police for over a
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,decade and they're\Nsupposed to be the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we're\Ngoing to summon him like
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.50,0:21:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,waving down some taxi\Nby force of will alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stay calm and take\Nthings slowly and carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what did ol' Rohan have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said the same thing as\Nyou, Josuke. Be careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi You have to be alert\Nwhen you cross the road
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for the trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mariah used to be a summer\Nescape for samurai I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such an out-there concept might be hard to\Nbelieve But my ancestors were among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were ruined during\Nmy grandfather's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have left is the house\Nthat I currently live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and my miserable little office job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.58,0:22:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to that nice\Nimported watch I bought you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left it in your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly,\NI was loose on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fix that tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.33,0:22:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.25,0:22:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you being coy all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.78,0:22:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, watch your step as you get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sublime weekend is beyond those doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be our getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.56,0:23:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this, you're tripping.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.70,0:23:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all becoming of a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.56,0:23:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect you to clean this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.42,0:23:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't recall your name, but\Nin the long run does it matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And brava, it's all clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.68,0:23:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be proud of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.78,0:23:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.56,0:23:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should make some dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.04,0:23:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the best dish in your repertoire?
